# Claude Code working files.
#
# Everything under .claude/ is ignored EXCEPT the vault's shared tooling:
# settings.json and the hooks that back the "archive before editing" rule.
#
# Why the exception: a blanket `.claude/` rule is how the original
# archive-before-edit hook was lost. The vault was copied here from
# C:\Users\lijumba\... without its .claude/ folder, CLAUDE.md went on claiming
# the hook existed, and nothing was archived. Keeping the hook tracked means it
# travels with the vault. See 01 Projects/CLAUDE.md.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/

# Machine-local overrides and session scratch stay out of the repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/

# Hook state file (regenerated automatically).
01 Projects/Kalemie/07 Narrative Craft/.last-archived

# Editor lock/temp files (Word, Obsidian plugins).
~$*
